.SH NAME
SDL_PRILLx \- A printf-formatting string for an
.BR "unsigned long long"
value as lower-case hexadecimal.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_stdinc.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_PRILLx SDL_PRILL_PREFIX \(dqx\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
